<title>UK: Caisse Centrale D'Epargne sets 990 mln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Caisse Centrale D'Epargne sets 990 mln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager CDC Marches.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE D'EPARGNE</p>
<p> AMT    990 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    16.APR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.924   PAY DATE    16.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.624    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MANAGEMENT 0.05	UNDERWRIT  0.05	SELL CONC   1.60</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
